  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "微處理機系統",
    "sub_ename": "MICROPROCESSOR SYSTEMS",
    "describe_ch": "此門課在介紹微處理機的結構，如何與不同的記憶體，不同功能的周邊介面組成ㄧ完整系統。另外，再介紹微處理機的指令與如何編寫組合語言程式，利用此兩基本硬體與軟體觀念設計一完整系統。",
    "describe_eh": " The structure of a Microprocessor is introduced first in this course. Beside the Microprocessor, there are two important part in a Micro-processor-based system, Memory and I/O interface. So program Memory, Data Memory and I/O interface are introduced in this course. The Intonation and assembly language program are introduced later. To design an ip-based system worsteds of Hardware and software is the final stage in this course.",
    "pre_subname": "IEE1006邏輯設計",
    "pre_sub_id3": "IEE1006",
    "pre_sub_ename": "IEE1006 LOGIC DESIGN",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "知道微處理機的基本結構、指令功能與系統功能\t",
      "describe_en": "To know the basic structure, function and instruction of Micro-processor"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "應用上述的基本知識來設計微處理機應用系統",
      "describe_en": "To apply the basic knowledge of Micro-processor in designing the Micro-processor  application system\t"
    }
  ],
